            "action_name": {
              "value": "Retune"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: The melody on the wind is targeted by a spell with the auditory trait\n\nThe melody on the wind attempts to counteract the spell. If it succeeds, the spell effect is caught in a blast of wind that sweeps it back to its origin, affecting the caster. Targets of the triggering effect other than the melody on the wind are still affected normally."
